Hi,

Our next Open Printing call will be *today* Wednesday on 7 March.


Minutes from our last OP call are archived at:

ftp://ftp.pwg.org/pub/pwg/fsg/minutes/OP-Minutes-20120201.htm


Agenda:

(1) Status of Common Printing Dialog (Lars Uebernickel)

(2) Status of Common Mobile Print Client (Glen Petrie)

(3) Google Summer of Code 2012 - OP topics (Till)
- JTAPI, etc.

(4) PDF Filter Security Issues (Till)
- raised by Tim Waugh - see email discussions

(5) PWG / Open Printing Summit in April (Till, Ira)

- joint meeting w/ PWG at Apple 24-27 April 2012

(6) PWG Highlights for Open Printing (Ira McDonald)

